            <map to='#a0cbe8'>
              <bucket>&quot;{There&apos;s another continuity error here. Before Monica says I love you, Chandler&apos;s&#13;
holding the vests so that you couldn&apos;t see the collar, you could see all three, and they&#13;
were folding nicely. After she says the line and the camera cuts back to Chandler, you can&#13;
only see two out of the three, you can see the collar of the top one, and it looks like it&#13;
was folded sloppily, unlike before. Hey, you notice things while spending this much time&#13;
on this!&quot;</bucket>
